                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "PtznB",
                          "name": "abstractBlock",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "LsfQc",
                              "fill": "#666666",
                              "content": "Abstract",
                              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "fontStyle": "italic"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ubU2l",
                              "fill": "#222222",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "We introduce Diffusion-Augmented Reasoning (DAR), a framework that replaces autoregressive sampling of chain-of-thought traces with a latent diffusion process operating directly over a learned reasoning manifold. Instead of decoding tokens one step at a time, DAR jointly denoises an entire candidate trajectory and performs gradient-guided latent search to recover high-likelihood reasoning paths under a verifier reward. We show that this formulation unifies test-time search, RLHF-aligned scoring, and self-consistency under a single variational objective, and that it scales gracefully with additional inference compute. On the MATH benchmark, DAR improves over the strongest autoregressive CoT baseline by +14.2 points while reducing wall-clock inference cost by 3.8× at matched accuracy. Ablations indicate that most of the gain comes from latent-space refinement rather than from the diffusion prior itself, suggesting a clean separation between representation and search. We further observe transfer to GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, and a held-out olympiad set, with no task-specific tuning. 我们同时讨论了该方法在多语言推理上的初步表现。 Code, model weights, and evaluation scripts are released under a permissive license to support reproducibility.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.75,
                              "textAlign": "justify",
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "jaMVX",
                              "fill": "#888888",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Keywords — latent diffusion, chain-of-thought, reasoning, RLHF, inference scaling",
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 12,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "fontStyle": "italic"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "A4Y9Sk",
                          "name": "tocBlock",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 14,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "rectangle",
                              "id": "F2Nlz",
                              "fill": "#E5E5E4",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 1
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "H3bjI",
                              "fill": "#666666",
                              "content": "目录",
                              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "fontStyle": "italic"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "xvdcf",
                              "name": "tocList",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "layout": "vertical",
                              "gap": 10,
                              "children": [
                                {
